b.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxq83.jpg"}, {"id": 1573636, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxq84.jpg"}, {"id": 1573637, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scxq85.jpg"}], "slug": "stranded-souls", "storyline": "Decades ago, a devastating fire claimed the life of a young girl. Witnesses whispered that her mother, consumed by a fit of rage, lit the flames that sealed their doom. But that was only the beginning...\n\nThe girl's vengeful spirit roams the halls, watching, waiting. Can you uncover the truth behind the tragedy while evading her wrath? Or will you and your team become the next lost souls in her tale?\n\nOne of the game's most unique elements is the inclusion of piano playing as a key mechanic. In Stranded Souls, the piano is not just a background prop\u2014it plays a vital role in the story and gameplay. Certain melodies hold the power to calm the girl's spirit. Will you have the courage and skill to play the right tune when it matters most?", "summary": "Step into the haunting world of Stranded Souls, A co-op horror game designed to challenge your wits and test your courage, this game lets you gather up to 4 players to face the unknown, unravel mysteries, and survive the horrors that lie ahead.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/stranded-souls", "videos": [{"id": 154737, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "FQcKyZtdneo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FQcKyZtdneo", "title": "Stranded Souls | Official Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FQcKyZtdneo/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}